    "Cost": 3994928,
    "UIName": "Fire Falcon",
    "Id": "chassisdef_fire_falcon_FF-F",
    "Name": "Fire Falcon",
    "Details": "This variant is designed to destroy infantry and battle armored troops. Equipped with an active probe to sniff out targets, each side torso carries a Machine Gun Array with four machine guns for infantry, while the arms each carry an ER micro laser and ER small laser to deal with battle armor. For heavier targets, the Fire Falcon F carries a single ER large laser.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Sensors</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
